values.content:
Generate replies for these social media posts.

Brand: {{ $json.brandName }}
Description: {{ $json.brandDescription || 'not provided' }}
Brand voice: {{ $json.brandVoice }}
Do not mention: {{ $json.doNotMention.join(', ') || 'nothing specified' }}
Current promotion: {{ $json.currentPromotion || 'none' }}

Posts to reply to:
{{ $json.posts.map(p=>p.postId+' ['+p.platform+']['+p.postCategory+']'+(p.verified?' [VERIFIED]':'')+(p.followerCount?' ['+p.followerCount+' followers]':'')+(p.requiresUrgentResponse?' [URGENT]':'')+' @'+p.authorHandle+': '+p.postContent+(p.context?' (Context: '+p.context+')':'')).join('\n\n') }}

Return JSON:
{"replies":[{"post_id":"","platform":"","category":"","reply_text":"the reply — platform-appropriate length and tone","reply_strategy":"what approach this reply takes and why","escalate":false,"escalation_reason":null,"do_not_post_flag":false,"do_not_post_reason":null,"character_count":0}],"crisis_posts":["post IDs that represent potential brand crises requiring human review before any response"],"high_value_engagement":["post IDs from verified or high-follower accounts worth prioritizing"],"batch_summary":"1-2 sentences on the overall sentiment of this batch and any patterns"}
